{
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good, I woke up right on time today!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All right, it's just about time."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, where is Gensokyo's own Great Sage, Equal to Heaven?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're quick to seize an opportunity."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've recruited such a reassuring ally, and one of flesh, too.",
                "Now, let's begin."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This will be our final training session.",
                "Come at me!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I knew you were here for a fight."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm? You called?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Alright, that's enough."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I need you to work with the beast spirits to defend our territory once we've taken it."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Understood!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then what will you do, Lady Yachie?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm particularly interested in the Keiga Family.",
                "Their new friend looks rather capable."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...There she goes."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will pay the Keiga Family and the Gouyoku Alliance a visit.",
                "To keep them in their lane."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is <i$this> the right thing to do?",
                "Master Zanmu..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Welp, I'll have to leave it up to you."
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then... no matter who I fight,",
                "I'll be fine as long as it's fun!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Though it'd be great if I could find someone",
                "I wouldn't feel bad about beating up..."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A-a monkey!"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Earth really is more fun!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All the lifeforms here are so unusual."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey! You trying to pick a fight?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And their violent nature is so wonderful, too!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Shhh!"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O-okay."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'd never meet such exciting people in the",
                "Lunar Capital!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, so you were a moon rabbit.",
                "It's no wonder I've never seen your face before."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, that's right, Enoko the yamainu had the same thing!",
                "It's just like that jewel!"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Keep that to yourself and I'll give",
                "you a rematch sometime. Okay?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "This unearthly feeling wafting from that staff of yours..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder if Sanae came back yet."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, it's Biten!"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you come to play?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How have you been?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm fine, but what is the Kiketsu Family doing?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I haven't seen anything strange on the surface..."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The long-awaited decisive battle has already begun."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So ready yourself, Sanae!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What...?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The battle between the beast families",
                "is a total farce."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The decisive battle's already started?",
                "Really!?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, it's decisive in that there's going to be",
                "one clear victor."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Clear victor?",
                "You don't mean that oni, Zanmu...?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes.",
                "I feel sorry for Lady Yachie, but..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know what's going on,",
                "but I won!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, if it isn't Miss Son Biten.",
                "Lady Zanmu told me to expect you."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am Hisami Yomotsu.",
                "A guide to Hell."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell welcomes everyone, every time. Without my guidance,",
                "you will never find the place you seek."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see..."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then will you guide me?",
                "To Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm hm hm, of course I will.",
                "But first..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We must abide by the customs of Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Umm...this is Hell, right?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's so big and dark and empty here.",
                "Where am I supposed to go?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Welcome to Hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will now be your guide."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Was there a point to that battle?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Please do not think poorly of me.",
                "This was also part of Lady Zanmu's orders."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, I shall guide you as I was instructed."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm hm hm.",
                "Please relax, and enjoy your time in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "???"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Man, there are way too many people around",
                "here who'll find any excuse to fight."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, I shall guide your way,",
                "to the depths of Hell..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is this the place?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't look much better than where I was before."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's there?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Son Biten, right?",
                "What's Zanmu's monkey doing at my place?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? You're..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Suika Ibuki, an oni who silences crying children."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because that's just the way that woman works."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Zanmu throws people away when they stop being useful to her.",
                "Just like she threw away Former Hell."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And because of that, everyone worships",
                "the ground she walks on."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That woman is a true oni among oni."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I get it. You're here because",
                "Zanmu's thrown you away."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How does the truth make you feel? Sad? Angry, maybe?",
                "Even though you've tricked plenty of people yourself?"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just surprised.",
                "Master Zanmu truly does betray every expectation."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This world is full of oni, isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You were doomed to fall into Hell as soon as",
                "you devoured those phantoms in the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well, let's enjoy Hell to our hearts' content.",
                "It's not like you can leave on your own!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I already told you,",
                "you can never escape from Hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can beat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is frustrating..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'd never meet such exciting people in the",
                "Lunar Capital!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, most of the youkai of concern ",
                "have already been dealt with..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's time to go report to Lady Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's-huh? Wait, you're..."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, did you die?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why else would you wander into Higan?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Re...Reimu?!",
                "What are <i$you> doing in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After stepping back and observing the incident ",
                "I realised who the bad guys were."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I let you wander free",
                "until you showed your hand!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a pawn of that oni from hell.",
                "Prepare to be exorcised!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "An oni's pawn, huh?",
                "What makes you think that?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since you popped up out of nowhere,",
                "I did a little background check on you."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You met Zanmu back when you were just a monkey."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And soon after that, you became a youkai."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see. Well, I don't think I'm up to anything",
                "wicked, so I've got nothing to hide from you."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, I became a monkey god thanks to Master Zanmu's powers.",
                "That's why I'm working to fulfill her wishes."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even if you get in my way, Reimu,",
                "everything's already folding into place!"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everything rests in the palm of Master Zanmu's hand..."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\t...\t,\tZanmu\t,That woman",
                "...Zanmu's wishes, huh?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Alright, that just leaves two more."
            ]
        }
    }
}